lOk C ObR ObW (Op2.eff _ s2) _; rw [e₁]; exact this.1\n    · show Repr tok L _ (exec (Op2.eff _ s2) _); rw [e₁]; exact this.2\n\n\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ntime ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/MM23.lean 2>&1 | head -50","description":"Rewrite tokens and recursive-call proof parts, recompile"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
