{"parentUuid":"1f6d7dc0-f847-4838-a12a-58b6bd325589","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01QHMZHTNRHvkSymQJpGN9gv","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"28501cab-5922-4bb2-af78-e03bb34a88ea","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:41:26.451Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"28501cab-5922-4bb2-af78-e03bb34a88ea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgatEHpYi6iNdbmufULer","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G2vzE9MkKCNULdMPyGek1G","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep && git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 2: R1 for read3, R2 for write3 and writeShared\n\nWhy: MM-03.3 §9.2 asks that safe MM-03 reads and writes satisfy the MM-02\npreconditions (R1, R2), with Repr preserved by writes.\n\nWhat:\n- r1_read3: under Repr, WF3, NoDangling and FpLeaves, an ok read3 gives\n  for each leaf an ok ReadStep (never ub) whose value is the bytes of the\n  leaf's range, all initialised; dec and stat as explicit hypotheses (K5).\n- r2_write3, r2_writeShared: ok writes give ok WriteSteps for any bytes\n  written, and the arrival states stay in Repr.\n- FpLeaves (text WF3 clause 4, missing from the draft WF3) and\n  FrameOwnedLive, preserved by every Reachable step\n  (step_fpLeaves_frameOwnedLive) and true on reached states.\n- *_reachable corollaries discharging WF3, NoDangling, FpLeaves.\n- Counterexample kept: without NoDangling (draft canRead3 lacks O9.1),\n  read3 is ok, Repr holds, and the MM-02 read is ub.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 50\ntheorems use at most propext and Quot.sound; counterexample by decide.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23; cat >> $SP/log.md <<'EOF'\n7. Step 1 committed (b8fd6fd): Layout/LayoutWF/Repr/Placement/repr_extend/repr_writes/repr_init; topPlacement proves PlacementOK satisfiable. Found: omega on conjunction goals pulls Classical.choice -> split goals.\n8. Step 2: R1/R2 need NoDangling + FpLeaves (draft gaps). Proved FpLeaves and FrameOwnedLive on reached states by one Step lemma (19 cases) + Reachable induction. Kept counterexample cx: read3 ok, Repr, MM-02 read ub without NoDangling.\nEOF","description":"Commit step 2 and update the log"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":533,"cache_read_input_tokens":499941,"output_tokens":983,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":533,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":983,"cache_read_input_tokens":499941,"cache_creation_input_tokens":533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":533},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01G2vzE9MkKCNULdMPyGek1G":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep && git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 2: R1 for read3, R2 for write3 and writeShared\n\nWhy: MM-03.3 §9.2 asks that safe MM-03 reads and writes satisfy the MM-02\npreconditions (R1, R2), with Repr preserved by writes.\n\nWhat:\n- r1_read3: under Repr, WF3, NoDangling and FpLeaves, an ok read3 gives\n  for each leaf an ok ReadStep (never ub) whose value is the bytes of the\n  leaf's range, all initialised; dec and stat as explicit hypotheses (K5).\n- r2_write3, r2_writeShared: ok writes give ok WriteSteps for any bytes\n  written, and the arrival states stay in Repr.\n- FpLeaves (text WF3 clause 4, missing from the draft WF3) and\n  FrameOwnedLive, preserved by every Reachable step\n  (step_fpLeaves_frameOwnedLive) and true on reached states.\n- *_reachable corollaries discharging WF3, NoDangling, FpLeaves.\n- Counterexample kept: without NoDangling (draft canRead3 lacks O9.1),\n  read3 is ok, Repr holds, and the MM-02 read is ub.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 50\ntheorems use at most propext and Quot.sound; counterexample by decide.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23; cat >> $SP/log.md <<'EOF'\n7. Step 1 committed (b8fd6fd): Layout/LayoutWF/Repr/Placement/repr_extend/repr_writes/repr_init; topPlacement proves PlacementOK satisfiable. Found: omega on conjunction goals pulls Classical.choice -> split goals.\n8. Step 2: R1/R2 need NoDangling + FpLeaves (draft gaps). Proved FpLeaves and FrameOwnedLive on reached states by one Step lemma (19 cases) + Reachable induction. Kept counterexample cx: read3 ok, Repr, MM-02 read ub without NoDangling.\nEOF","description":"Commit step 2 and update the log"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01G2vzE9MkKCNULdMPyGek1G":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"9e87e9d1-7d2a-483e-a186-2a90b77e27c9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgatEHZvo96e4mxCeP9Pi","requestRef":"99fa7ce2-ecb5-45cf-8661-cba9c572a81a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"df80b508-356a-413f-b6fb-73233a6350b1","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:41:26.451Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
